WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:17.490
Ten years have passed since Inazuma Japan won the Football Frontier International tournament.

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:24.960
As a result, Japan's reputation with soccer increased remarkably.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:31.870
Many of the world-leading Inazuma Japan team came from Raimon Junior High School.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:35.640
It has now become a school famous for its soccer.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:46.340
This is a new tale of the many heroes from Raimon Jr. High soccer club as they face a turbulent turn in the soccer world.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.640
The time has come.

00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:05.730
It doesn't matter if it leads to the destruction of my own self.

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:11.090
For what I believe in, I offer everything I have.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.170
Everything you have...

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.470
Is your wish that important to you?

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.190
Yes.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:23.180
This wish cannot be granted unless I am willing to risk any sacrifice.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.430
I see.

00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:29.390
So you take it as your divine will.

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:33.190
Then declare this wish of yours.

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.160
I...

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:41.830
...will control soccer!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:01:59.090
Morning, Sasuke!

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.470
How's it look on me?

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.380
I'll get to play tons of soccer today!

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:06.520
Isn't that great?

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.220
I see, I see!

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:11.940
You're happy too, aren't you, Sasuke?

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.270
Then I'll see you later!

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:16.900
Have a good time!

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.860
Good morning!

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:25.990
Good luck!

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.590
I'm finally here.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:44.680
Raimon Jr. High!

00:02:45.590 --> 00:02:48.340
I'll get to play soccer!

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.240
It's the Raimon mark I've always admired.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.060
It's just like I imagined it!

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:58.360
Really shows that it's a famous school, I'm so impressed!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.370
There's still time before the ceremony, so it should be fine to take a little look around.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.610
The soccer club is...

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.760
So this is the soccer club?

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.510
I wonder if this is the club room.

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.640
Need something?

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.100
Did I surprise you?

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.200
Sorry about that.

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.470
That spooked me.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.400
Is this the club room for the soccer club?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:32.930
This is the old club room left here as a relic.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.510
It's not being used these days.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.230
Is that so?

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:40.260
Then where is the club room now?

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.020
Over here.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.400
It's this building.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:53.040
C-Club room...

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.060
You mean this?!

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.540
Rather than a club room, it's the soccer building.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.840
Soccer building?

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:04.390
Then this entire building is for the soccer club?!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:05.890
Yes, that's right!

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:08.920
This is...

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:10.970
Raimon's soccer club!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.080
And I'm the soccer club's counselor, Otonashi Haruna.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:18.630
Oh, you're the counselor here?

00:04:18.970 --> 00:04:21.190
So what were you looking to do here?

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:25.110
I'm a new student who wants to join the club!

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:27.830
The soccer club?

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:29.530
I see.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:30.360
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.790
I hope I can join!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.430
My name is Matsukaze Tenma.

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:17.390
This is a big problem, Kudou-kun!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:22.690
We can't have you going on without understanding soccer under its current condition.

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.420
Am I clear?

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:28.340
If you won't obey your superiors, we'll have you resign your position.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:31.270
It's the era of managed soccer now.

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:38.050
Just about all of the jr. high schools are under the management,
under which they receive special education through soccer.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:44.590
Unlike the time when Raimon was the chairman,
your methods are no longer valid in this age.

00:06:46.120 --> 00:06:48.940
Don't you at least have any explanation?

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:52.300
I refuse to corrupt my way of doing things.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:57.910
It seems it's only a matter of time before you'll be leaving this school.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.360
If this discussion is done, I'll excuse myself.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:04.980
Why are you so persistent about Raimon's soccer club?

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.400
I'm waiting for the right time.

00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:11.760
There's trouble!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:14.130
W-We need you at the grounds immediately!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.730
What's wrong?

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:16.650
The soccer club...

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.620
Something terrible's happened to the soccer club!

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.130
So you want to join?

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.770
But we haven't even had the induction ceremony yet, so what brings you here so early in the morning?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:33.750
I wanted to get here before anyone else and stake out my claim to join the club!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.720
I don't want them telling me that they're full, after all.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.430
You really like soccer.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:41.140
Yes, I love it!

00:07:41.780 --> 00:07:45.360
I've had my mind set on joining the soccer club once I got into jr. high school.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:50.220
That's why I'm really happy I got into Raimon after admiring it for so long!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:51.410
I see then.

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:55.090
Okay. Matsukaze Tenma-kun, was it?

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:56.240
Good luck!

00:07:57.190 --> 00:07:58.870
Thank you!

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:01.350
You're a bit like him.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.830
When I look at you, I end up remembering someone I knew a long time ago.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.900
Oh, that reminds me!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.240
Is it all right if I go watch the soccer club practice?

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.240
Are they doing any morning practice?

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:15.430
Let's see...

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.970
Practice should be starting on the second grounds soon.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.430
I want to see it! Can I go watch?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.160
W-What the heck is this?

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.540
Risuno-kun! Risuno-kun!

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:51.630
Is that all you've got?

00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:54.470
How could you do this?!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:59.140
I've destroyed Raimon's soccer club.

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:01.310
Do you think you can get away with this?

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.520
Tell us your name and class!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.720
Wouldn't know, since today's my first day.

00:09:06.720 --> 00:09:08.000
New student?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:08.650
What's your name?

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:12.380
Tsurugi Kyousuke.

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.110
So you're Coach Kudou?

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.660
We're here.

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:23.030
What is it?

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.040
What's going on?

00:09:29.450 --> 00:09:31.960
You've destroyed the soccer club?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.810
Yeah. Soccer's useless, don't you think?

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:35.790
It's a waste of time.

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:36.800
Coach Kudou!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.250
What makes you think you can just start a fight here?

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.450
Fight?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:44.170
Did I do any fighting here?

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.260
Eh?

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.900
This guy never used his fists.

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:54.650
All he used was that one soccer ball, and we...

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.080
No way...

00:10:08.150 --> 00:10:09.430
It's true.

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.620
That ball he kicked...

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.290
All it took was one guy to finish all of us.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:15.550
Why...

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:18.510
Why are you doing this?!

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.820
No one needs soccer.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.600
So I'm going to destroy it.

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:27.420
Starting from today, the soccer club is disbanded.

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:28.930
Disbanded?

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:31.940
Do you think you can just do that?!

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.160
Oh, I can.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:36.890
Do you have a grudge against soccer or something?

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.610
Grudge?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:39.530
Well, who knows.

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:42.780
A grudge against soccer?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.950
But one thing I can say for sure...

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:50.210
...is that wastes of time like soccer aren't needed!

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:02.130
Are you trying to insult soccer?

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:04.170
Insult?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:06.690
Don't get so worked up, teacher.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.730
W-What did you say?

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:09.620
Wait.

00:11:11.140 --> 00:11:12.640
Soccer is...

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:15.330
Soccer isn't a waste of time.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:18.460
Soccer isn't a waste of time, and it <i>is</i>  needed.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.530
Huh?!

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.160
Oh, um, err...

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.160
Who the heck are you?

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.370
I-I'm Matsukaze Tenma.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.080
I'm joining the soccer club today.

00:11:34.990 --> 00:11:36.490
Too bad for you.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.930
As of right now, it's gone.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.760
Go join another club.

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.390
But...

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:45.610
I came here to play soccer!

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:47.680
I can't just let the soccer club disappear!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.370
Can't let it?

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.460
I see.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:53.340
Seems you have a lot of confidence with your soccer.

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:56.820
Then show me this soccer of yours.

00:12:00.450 --> 00:12:01.740
Tenma-kun, are you okay?

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:04.860
What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:05.260 --> 00:12:07.320
It ticks me off...

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:11.500
When newbies like you start talking about soccer like they know everything about it.

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.900
I <i>do</i>  know.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.430
I know what soccer is like!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:21.690
Then why don't you show me your real skills?

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:26.090
How about we start with a contest between you and me?

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:28.230
Contest?

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:29.350
What?

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:31.740
Are you going to take back what you just said?

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:33.700
I-I won't!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.750
I'll do it!

00:12:35.320 --> 00:12:36.060
Tenma-kun!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.600
Bring it.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.940
Just try me.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:59.530
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:17.560
If you steal the ball from me, then it's your win.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.270
Coach Kudou! Is it really okay to let them do this?

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:24.440
Coach!

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.330
If I steal the ball, I win.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.380
Yeah.

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.470
If you win, I'll let the soccer club continue.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:35.630
If you lose, then the soccer club's over.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:37.810
Chairman Kinzan!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:40.620
Please make them stop this!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:44.100
No, I'll allow this contest.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:50.050
I've been feeling that the soccer club would be needing reform in the near future.

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:54.470
They have no value in existing if they lose to a single new student.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:00.040
What was your name again?

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:02.270
Matsukaze Tenma.

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.640
Matsukaze-kun.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.740
The fate of the soccer club lies with you.

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:09.620
I'll let you handle this.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.100
Take care of it.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:14.560
Wait a moment!

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:16.260
Are you serious about this?

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:18.910
Principal Fuyukai, say something!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.170
Chairman, is this really okay?

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.580
He's probably a spy{assassin} sent in from Fifth Sector.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.840
Then would this be part of the Holy Emperor's plan?

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:34.180
I assume the Holy Emperor has something in mind.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.690
It's best if we comply with them for now.

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:42.140
This is my decision as the chairman.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:43.940
Ch-Chairman?

00:14:45.020 --> 00:14:46.880
Then it's set.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.980
Will you be okay, Tenma-kun?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:53.380
I've been practicing dribbling by myself every day.

00:14:53.380 --> 00:14:54.830
I-I can do this.

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.490
Dribbling by yourself?

00:14:58.440 --> 00:14:59.490
That's it?

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:02.940
It's all right, it'll work out somehow.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:05.970
Okay!

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:17.990
Now then...

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:20.350
Let's play soccer.

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:21.900
Tenma-kun.

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.320
If I steal the ball, I win.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.740
All right, it'll work out somehow.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.360
Take this!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:34.130
Huh?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.740
This time...

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.290
Amazing.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.900
I knew it.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.700
It's impossible. He's just getting bullied.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.390
There's no way he'll win.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.710
He wasn't a match in the first place.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.060
What's wrong? Done already?

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.130
Not yet!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:36.090
You sure don't have a lot to show after bragging so much about knowing soccer.

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:38.140
Just as I thought...

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.050
You're the type I hate the most!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:43.770
Tenma-kun!

00:16:51.130 --> 00:16:52.570
Ow...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:54.570
I'm not done yet!

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:02.420
This is hopeless.

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:04.210
There's just too much of a difference in their skill.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:09.660
Should I put an end to this soon?

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.020
Not...

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.170
Not yet...

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.660
He's ready to snap.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:21.300
So this is the end of the soccer club?

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:22.730
But look.

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.100
Isn't he a bit impressive?

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:30.230
He still lacks a lot of technique, but his movements...

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:37.310
Compared to when he started out, he's been moving more in ways that minimizes the damage he takes on.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.170
What? How?

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.370
I think he's predicting the projection of the ball coming at him.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:43.430
No way.

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:48.420
It's just that Tsurugi's speed is above that still.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:55.800
Are you sure about that?

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.720
M-Maybe I was just imagining it...

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.680
He must be a Seed.

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:06.500
That technique isn't of the normal breed.

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:11.070
The soccer elite group tempered by Fifth Sector, Seed.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:15.690
I've heard that they receive perfectly thorough special education on soccer.

00:18:16.130 --> 00:18:18.630
So he's one of them?

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:24.080
Besides that, the boy who's challenging that Seed...

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.180
Matsukaze Tenma, was it?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:28.210
Yes, sir.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.820
He seems to be a new student.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:33.790
He's putting up a pretty good fight.

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.160
I'm starting to get bored.

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.220
Let's put an end to this.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.520
He's going to do it!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:46.140
The shoot that defeated all of us in one blow!

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.240
Death Sword!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.380
I made it this far so I could play soccer!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:14.080
That's what I've decided!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.390
Ever since that day...

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.080
Tenma!

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:43.630
Are you okay, Tenma?

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.200
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:46.530
Thank goodness.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:03.640
I'm going to play soccer!

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:07.100
If I have my mind set to do it, I'll do it no matter what!

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:21.190
I...

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:22.450
I got it!

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.200
What?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:29.880
That guy...

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:32.270
He got it.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.580
Tenma-kun got the ball!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.540
Now that Tenma-kun has the ball, that means he wins!

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:40.760
Now I'll get to play soccer!

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.950
Quit it with your "soccer, soccer"!

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:45.180
It pisses me off!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.180
Wait! That's not what you promised-

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:52.810
What?

00:20:55.860 --> 00:20:57.340
You guys!

00:20:57.340 --> 00:21:00.570
What do you think you're doing on the soccer club's sacred grounds?!

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:02.120
Shindou-kun!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:04.990
That person is...

00:21:06.850 --> 00:21:08.640
He finally showed up.

